Origin
------

This project is a fork of the ownCloud "impersonate" app
(https://github.com/owncloud/impersonate, archived in 2026), created on
2026-11-26 and maintained by Marek Królikowski (TaKeN). Since the fork the
app was adapted to ownCloud 11.1 and its security was hardened; large parts
were rewritten and new components were added (see CHANGELOG.md and the git
history).

Portions of the code originate from the ownCloud app and remain

  Copyright (C) 2015-2026 ownCloud GmbH and contributors
  (Jörn Friedrich Dreyer, Sujith Haridasan, Jannik Stehle and others,
